                <head>123. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On October 5, 1960, the President approved NSC Action No. 2315, in which the NSC
                    concurred in the recommendation of the Secretary of Defense that a total of 14
                    Polaris submarines be authorized for construction, and that long lead-time
                    planning and procurement actions be authorized to permit construction of 5
                    additional Polaris submarines. (Department of State, S/S–NSC (Miscellaneous)
                    Files: Lot 66 D 95, Records of Action by the National Security Council) NSC
                    Action No. 2315 superseded NSC Action No. 2168–b; see <ref target="#d82-f5"
                        >footnote 4, Document 82</ref>.</p>
            </div>
